    module_vol_id = 205,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_is_pic = 1,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "Under Gavin's \"rectification\", the order had been restored to the underground. During the supply distribution and evacuation of the trapped people, Gavin took you to see a [c][f78585]special device[-][/c] he found. You believed that Joker used this to collect Evol energy to unlock the Lighthouse quickly."
