    module_type = 1,
    module_is_pic = 1,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "You and Gavin decided to examine it more closely after the evacuation was over, yet the NW barged in and carried out a forceful rescue operation. After being rectified by Gavin, you and the NW agreed upon temporary cooperation in the evacuation. At this point, you received a warning from the Special Task Force over the headset—Loveland City entered a state of emergency once again. The mist reappeared, and the Game of Hunters continued."
