    module_is_pic = 1,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "You woke up in your cell on the NW's Prison Island—Five days ago, when you and Victor smashed the slab together, NW locked you up again. Victor would always walk past your cell whenever he was taken to the interrogation room, which was the only chance you got to see him each day. And today was no different."
