    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "After returning to Loveland City, Goldman reported to Victor that the board decided not long ago to host a charity soccer tournament with [c][f78585]Fulcrum Foundation[-][/c] founded three years ago, as well as other businesses. After you and Victor learned about this, you both felt that it seemed suspicious."
