    module_is_pic = 1,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "So the next day, you two attended the opening ceremony but was faced with a drone [c][f78585]Evolver \"judgment\"[-][/c]. Victor calmly dealt with the crisis and quickly planned with the police outside the venue to blow up the helicopter. He succeeded with the cooperation of the staff and police."
