    module_vol_id = 208,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "You woke up three days later, but you only remember Victor kicking you out of the BS conference three days ago. The news on TV was about the Special Task Force cracking the radiation case and investigating the man behind it. You arrived at LFG and \"pressed\" Victor for answers to why he kicked you out of BS. He told you that he has a job for you and gave you a document on [c][f78585]Loveland City Restoration[-][/c] Project. [c][f78585]The person in charge of this project[-][/c] happened to be [c][f78585]Leto[-][/c]."
  },
  [80110] = {
    module_page_id = 2075,
    order_in_page = 10,
    module_unlock_request = 312915,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear 29-15 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 208,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "You expressed your doubts about the project, but Victor told you that LFG accepted the contract for the restoration of a mountain manor. After three days, he will be meeting with the representative from the Fulcrum Foundation that owns the land. You will also be presented as the meeting's media company."
  },
  [80111] = {
    module_page_id = 2075,
    order_in_page = 11,
    module_unlock_request = 312915,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear 29-15 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 208,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "Upon morning, Victor, Goldman, and you arrived at the [c][f78585]Cliff Manor[-][/c]. You were told that the representative from the foundation fell ill at the last minute and couldn't make the meeting. As one of the most gruesome sites with the highest death tolls for the last Game of Hunters, there was blood everywhere, and you could swear that you saw a shadowy figure dart from the corner of your eyes. After a thrilling investigation, it turned out to be the works of an Evolver."
  },
  [80112] = {
    module_page_id = 2075,
    order_in_page = 12,
    module_unlock_request = 312915,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear 29-15 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 208,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_connect_id = 80113,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_delay = 5,
    module_desc = "You have decided to investigate the mystery here. In order to draw away the suspiciously acting Goldman, you were investigating a somewhat abnormal room at Victor's behest when you heard a sound coming from their direction. You quickly arrived and saw Goldman pinning Victor tightly against the balcony. But Victor clearly has already thought up a way to escape."
  },
  [80113] = {
    module_page_id = 2075,
    order_in_page = 13,
    module_unlock_request = 312915,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear 29-15 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 208,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 3,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "\"Do you really think you're going to win?\"",
    module_card_id = 51580,
    module_CG_zoom = 0.83,
    module_remove = "'0,-250",
    module_voice = "voice_122607_31.mp3",
    module_voice_species = 0,
    module_voice_delay = 0.5
  },
  [80114] = {
    module_page_id = 2075,
    order_in_page = 14,
    module_unlock_request = 312915,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear 29-15 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 208,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_connect_id = 80115,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_delay = 11,
    module_desc = "It would appear that Goldman's body had been switched. During the scuffle, you saved Victor's [c][f78585]pocket watch[-][/c] that nearly fell down the cliff while Victor made short work of the Goldman impostor. Defeated, the \"Goldman\" revealed that he colluded with the shadowy figure to scare people away so he could find out the Time Evolver to save the person that saved his life by returning the Manor to a previous timeline. He constantly failed on that mission until one day, he found a [c][f78585]black box[-][/c] that granted him the ability to switch bodies. Faced with his plea to rewind time, Victor adamantly refused."
  },
  [80115] = {
    module_page_id = 2075,
    order_in_page = 15,
    module_unlock_request = 312915,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear 29-15 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 208,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 2,
    module_desc = "\"This power is only for the person that I hold the dearest.\"",
    role1 = 1100000,
    role2 = 102102,
    role3 = 102201,
    role5 = 1100402,
    module_role_zoom_rate = 0.5,
    module_remove = "'0,-200",
    module_background_id = 3190,
    module_voice = "voice_122608_103.mp3",
    module_voice_species = 0,
    module_voice_delay = 0.5
  },
  [80116] = {
    module_page_id = 2075,
    order_in_page = 16,
    module_unlock_request = 312915,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear 29-15 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 208,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_connect_id = 80117,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_delay = 5,
    module_desc = "The Cliff Manor was soon fixed up. Victor planned to attend the opening ceremony but predicted that there will be complications on that night. Just as he predicted, you were attacked while inside the office. In a pinch, the helicopter Victor secretly prepared arrived just in time. Despite just going through a life-or-death situation, Victor looked extremely calm."
  },
  [80117] = {
    module_page_id = 2075,
    order_in_page = 17,
    module_unlock_request = 312915,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear 29-15 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 208,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 3,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "\"It is much more damaging if I die in full view of everyone.\"",
    module_card_id = 51581,
    module_CG_zoom = 0.83,
    module_remove = "'0,-220",
    module_voice = "voice_122609_71.mp3",
    module_voice_species = 0,
    module_voice_delay = 0.5
  },
  [80118] = {
    module_page_id = 2075,
    order_in_page = 18,
    module_unlock_request = 312915,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear 29-15 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 208,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "During the opening ceremony, you got word that a bomb was planted somewhere, so you evacuated the guests and resolved the issue successfully by detonating the bomb under the cover of the fireworks that Victor arranged."
  },
  [80119] = {
    module_page_id = 2075,
    order_in_page = 19,
    module_unlock_request = 312915,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear 29-15 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 208,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "On the second day, Victor told you there was something strange with the box that allowed ordinary people to become Evolvers. He wanted you to investigate GR."
  },
  [80120] = {
    module_page_id = 2075,
    order_in_page = 20,
    module_unlock_request = 312915,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear 29-15 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 208,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "Afterward, you met up with Doven and traded some information on Victor in exchange for a chance to meet with the CEO of GR."
  },
  [80121] = {
    module_page_id = 2075,
    order_in_page = 21,
    module_unlock_request = 312915,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear 29-15 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 208,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "You received a phone call from Doven early in the morning. He wanted to meet you in person with GR to discuss your membership. The designated location was at the [c][f78585]teahouse[-][/c] where you and Doven met last time. Here, you met with GR's [c][f78585]vice president Lamont[-][/c]. He wanted you to take part in a [c][f78585]test[-][/c] to win the trust of GR. It turned out the test wanted you to kill Shaw. Just as you hesitantly made the phone call to inform Shaw of the incoming trouble, the door was kicked open, and it was Shaw that stood at the door."
  },
  [80122] = {
    module_page_id = 2075,
    order_in_page = 22,
    module_unlock_request = 312915,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear 29-15 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 208,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_connect_id = 80123,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_delay = 6,
    module_desc = "Men from GR quickly made their escape, leaving only a small and weak-looking boy who goes by the name of \"Stutter\". To pass GR's [c][f78585]test[-][/c], you faked hostility between you and Shaw. Thankfully, he saw through the facade and decided to act along. Shaw pretended to apprehend you, tying both you and Stutter together."
  },
  [80123] = {
    module_page_id = 2075,
    order_in_page = 23,
    module_unlock_request = 312915,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear 29-15 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 208,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 3,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "\"From this moment on, you're kidnapped.\"",
    module_card_id = 58110,
    module_CG_zoom = 0.83,
    module_remove = "'0,-250",
    module_voice = "voice_122613_84.mp3",
    module_voice_species = 0,
    module_voice_delay = 0.5
  },
  [80124] = {
    module_page_id = 2075,
    order_in_page = 24,
    module_unlock_request = 312915,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear 29-15 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 208,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_connect_id = 80125,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_delay = 5,
    module_desc = "He \"interrogated\" you about GR while you pretended to resist in order to win GR's trust. During Shaw's brief absence, you learned that Stutter was once bullied by the Evolvers. To keep the facade going and to encourage him, you came up with a ruse and bested Shaw."
  },
  [80125] = {
    module_page_id = 2075,
