    module_type = 1,
    module_connect_id = 80220,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_delay = 7,
    module_desc = "After countless setbacks, you started to doubt the program you filmed. Kiro arrived and read you like an open book. After a few questions from him, he made you realize that sometimes you forget yourself as you dwell in your own little world. Kiro encouraged you and told you to constantly remind yourself, and you'll know what to do."
  },
