    module_type = 1,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "Poseidon appeared in the name of picking up Boss. You learned from him that someone released a video in the name of \"reconstructing Loveland City\" and claimed that the [c][f78585]mechanical boxes[-][/c] could grant normal people Evol without suffering from deterioration. Despite the fact that the [c][f78585]council[-][/c] was debunking the rumor, the mechanical boxes had begun to circulate wildly."
  },
  [90304] = {
    module_page_id = 2081,
    order_in_page = 4,
    module_unlock_request = 313320,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear stage 33-20 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 209,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "For some reason, Victor decided to leave with Poseidon. In the meantime, you found that the mechanical boxes were being sought after, as GR didn't seem to have spread the warning. You dialed Doven's number, yet no one picked up. As anxiety filled your heart, you received a call from Gavin."
  },
  [90305] = {
    module_page_id = 2081,
    order_in_page = 5,
    module_unlock_request = 313320,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear stage 33-20 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 209,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "The [c][f78585]blood disease[-][/c], the mechanical boxes... Too many things happened since you parted. Despite Gavin's casual words, you could sense that he had undergone something during this time."
  },
  [90306] = {
    module_page_id = 2081,
    order_in_page = 6,
    module_unlock_request = 313320,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear stage 33-20 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 209,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "On the way to the Fulcrum Foundation, you received another mysterious message. Then you saw the video Doven released online, claiming that the [c][f78585]\"New Year Coup\"[-][/c] was a mass murder to cover up [c][f78585]three secrets[-][/c], including [c][f78585]Evolver's deterioration[-][/c]. He demanded you and Gavin see the current director with him, or he would reveal all the secrets to the public."
  },
  [90307] = {
    module_page_id = 2081,
    order_in_page = 7,
    module_unlock_request = 313320,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear stage 33-20 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 209,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "Gavin went with you to see Silas for your safety. He said he would cooperate but wouldn't let you take any risks. But Silas claimed that the secrets would lead to more sacrifices once they were exposed. You understood what it meant and decided to cooperate. But then a strange [c][f78585]black wind[-][/c] began to swirl around Gavin."
  },
  [90308] = {
    module_page_id = 2081,
    order_in_page = 8,
    module_unlock_request = 313320,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear stage 33-20 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 209,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "After you two left NW, you contacted Doven and came to where the \"New Year Coup\" started. Despite Gavin's persuasion, Doven insisted on meeting the [c][f78585]current director[-][/c] at [c][f78585]NW's main laboratory[-][/c]."
  },
  [90309] = {
    module_page_id = 2081,
    order_in_page = 9,
    module_unlock_request = 313320,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear stage 33-20 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 209,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_connect_id = 90310,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_delay = 7,
    module_desc = "Gavin agreed to Doven's request and took him to see Silas at NW's main laboratory. Yet Silas didn't remember Doven as a victim and told him that Gavin was a crucial member of the NW plan. When Silas was about to get rid of Doven, Gavin stopped him with his wind blades. He mocked that Gavin was feeling sorry for a criminal, only to face furious rebuke."
  },
  [90310] = {
    module_page_id = 2081,
    order_in_page = 10,
    module_unlock_request = 313320,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear stage 33-20 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 209,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 2,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "\"No one should be given up.\"",
    role1 = 4132000,
    role2 = 402107,
    role3 = 402206,
    role5 = 4132401,
    module_role_zoom_rate = 0.5,
    module_remove = "0,-214",
    module_background_id = 1692,
    module_voice = "voice_123206_78.mp3",
    module_voice_species = 0,
    module_voice_delay = 0.5
  },
  [90311] = {
    module_page_id = 2081,
    order_in_page = 11,
    module_unlock_request = 313320,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear stage 33-20 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 209,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_connect_id = 90312,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_delay = 15,
    module_desc = "In the face of the stalemate, Doven suddenly wanted some alone time with Silas. Gavin said in frustration that hostility could never solve anything, and he could prove that there were other ways. Yet he was rejected, and you both left the room. Soon enough, an explosion rang out. You two hurried back, only to find that Doven had obtained [c][f78585]an Evol[-][/c] through the mechanical box to kill Silas and sacrifice himself. When Gavin saw Silas's contempt for human life, the black wind rose again. He angrily said that lives are more than just numbers that could be wiped out so easily, and that sacrificing lives so easily would only lead to disasters. Gavin finally calmed down under your comfort, yet you knew full well that the wounds in his heart remained."
  },
  [90312] = {
    module_page_id = 2081,
    order_in_page = 12,
    module_unlock_request = 313320,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear stage 33-20 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 209,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 2,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "\"Thank you... for appearing in my life.\"",
    role1 = 4131000,
    role2 = 403106,
    role3 = 403203,
    role5 = 4131401,
    module_role_zoom_rate = 0.5,
    module_remove = "0,-214",
    module_background_id = 1692,
    module_voice = "voice_123208_102.mp3",
    module_voice_species = 0,
    module_voice_delay = 0.5
  },
  [90313] = {
    module_page_id = 2081,
    order_in_page = 13,
    module_unlock_request = 313320,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear stage 33-20 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 209,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "NW transferred you to somewhere else. Silas then showed up again to tell you that Gavin was the star of tomorrow's [c][f78585]celebration party[-][/c]. After he left, you leaned on Gavin and shut your eyes tiredly."
  },
  [90314] = {
    module_page_id = 2081,
    order_in_page = 14,
    module_unlock_request = 313320,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear stage 33-20 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 209,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_connect_id = 90315,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_delay = 4,
    module_desc = "After you woke up, you found Gavin at the end of the corridor. This time, you didn't leave him alone but handcuffed yourself to him and listened to all his thoughts and frustrations."
  },
  [90315] = {
    module_page_id = 2081,
