    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "Due to various reasons, Silas began to suspect Lucien, which would hinder what Lucien wanted to do in NW. You decided to stop hiding behind him and told Silas about the [c][f78585]folded world[-][/c] and other civilizations, claiming that you and Lucien were temporarily partnering together."
