    module_vol_id = 210,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "According to the plan, you used Core's power on the slab in the Place of Descent. A closed [c][f78585]door[-][/c] soon projected from the slab, which only opened when Eos appeared. It then projected BS's [c][f78585]declaration[-][/c], which you noticed to be different from the one you saw at the [c][f78585]Hacker Summit[-][/c] in the past."
