    module_desc = "You then were pulled into a different dimension with a [c][f78585]white staircase[-][/c] calling you over. Victor then appeared next to you and told you this space was [c][f78585]built by Evol[-][/c] and would only open to Core. He used Eos's power to climb up the stairs with you."
