    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_delay = 20,
    module_desc = "You proposed a deal to Victor. You informed B.S. about the [c][f78585]countdown[-][/c] and opened the door to the [c][f78585]Black Cabin[-][/c] while B.S. seemed to be planning something of their own. Victor promised that B.S. would lend its power to you. Before asking further, Victor extended an offer to talk in private and took you away from the B.S. building. As a familiar scene played out on the street, you realized that Victor also seemed to realize that something was off. You walked inside a church with Victor, who then proceeded to reveal that he could extend the window when the timer elapsed so you could have a better chance. He stroked your hair as he shared with you that he seemed to notice the [c][f78585]memories[-][/c] that didn't belong to him a long time ago and the small anomalies that he observed in the world."
  },
