    module_vol_id = 211,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "As you suspected, you managed to find Shaw inside. As you told him about the situation going on in the city, you noticed that the flow of time differed from the real world. He took out his [c][f78585]Dragonfly Eye[-][/c] where you saw a lot of different footage. Shaw said that he was completely unaware of the recent happenings, and suddenly realized that the [c][f78585]lines representing each world[-][/c] had converged into one."
