    module_desc = "Odyssey was set in a post-apocalyptic Loveland City, where [c][f78585]player skills[-][/c] were modeled after Evol powers. As you both played, you found the game somewhat unpolished. However, Aether, the head of Infinite and your in-game guide insisted on rushing the launch as it was the key to the world's evolution."
