    module_type = 1,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "After the Odyssey tournament, Kiro left Loveland City on some B.S. business. With your company's finances beginning to recover, you and a few colleagues organized a company dinner to celebrate. During the meal, Anna brought up a disturbing rumor: a murder case supposedly linked to Odyssey, where the victim had allegedly been killed using an in-game [c][f78585]skill[-][/c]. Alarmed, you reached out to Aether for confirmation. He assured you it was just an internet rumor, and you finally felt at ease. Midway through the evening, you spotted Gavin at another table dining with a group of unfamiliar faces in a noticeably awkward atmosphere. When he caught sight of you, his eyes lit up, and he subtly signaled for help. Playing along, you approached and pretended to be a long-lost [c][f78585]schoolmate[-][/c], successfully \"rescuing\" him from the tense gathering."
  },
  [160403] = {
    module_page_id = 2110,
    order_in_page = 1,
    module_unlock_request = 315815,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear stage 58-15 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 216,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "Once outside, Gavin explained that he had recently joined the Cybersecurity Bureau, and that dinner was part of a welcome party organized by his new colleagues. You were happy for him, though a little worried that the new role would also come with more difficult responsibilities. On your way back to the room, you overheard Minor and Willow on a phone call, discussing whether to call the police—Kiki had just been scammed out of a thousand dollars inside Odyssey."
  },
  [160404] = {
    module_page_id = 2110,
    order_in_page = 1,
    module_unlock_request = 315815,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear stage 58-15 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 216,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "According to Kiki, her guild leader had convinced her to invest in building and expanding the guild, only to disappear with the money. After dinner, Gavin checked with his new colleagues and confirmed that [c][f78585]fraud[-][/c] within the game had recently been on the rise. He advised you to stay alert. When you asked how he was adjusting to the new job, he admitted that the style was quite different from the Special Task Force, and he was still trying to adapt. You offered to help however you could. He paused, then said there was indeed something you could assist with: facilitating a partnership between your company and CyberSec to launch a [c][f78585]public awareness campaign[-][/c] on cybercrime prevention. You agreed without hesitation. Just then, Gavin received a call. After hanging up, he told you about an ongoing case involving a suspicious death potentially linked to Odyssey."
  },
  [160405] = {
    module_page_id = 2110,
    order_in_page = 1,
    module_unlock_request = 315815,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear stage 58-15 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 216,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_connect_id = 160406,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_delay = 5,
    module_desc = "In the interrogation room, the suspect remained firm under questioning, denying any knowledge of the victim's death. Gavin then presented game footage showing the suspect using a skill against the victim in-game—at the exact same time, the victim had died in the real world, in the same manner."
  },
  [160406] = {
    module_page_id = 2110,
    order_in_page = 1,
    module_unlock_request = 315815,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear stage 58-15 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 216,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 3,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "\"All those coincidences are stacked on one corpse. You still think it's just a fluke?\"",
    module_card_id = 54820,
    module_CG_zoom = 0.83,
    module_remove = "0,-200",
    module_voice = "voice_125804_26.mp3",
    module_voice_species = 0,
    module_voice_delay = 0.5
  },
  [160407] = {
    module_page_id = 2110,
    order_in_page = 1,
    module_unlock_request = 315815,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear stage 58-15 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 216,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "The suspect's denial seemed genuine, so Gavin contacted Aether for more information. Aether agreed to cooperate with the investigation and invited Gavin to attend an upcoming summit."
  },
  [160408] = {
    module_page_id = 2110,
    order_in_page = 1,
    module_unlock_request = 315815,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear stage 58-15 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 216,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "You were stunned by the bizarre case. Seeing how burdened Gavin was, you suggested that he try reviewing other cases to refresh his mind, and reminded him to get plenty of rest after he was done tonight."
  },
  [160409] = {
    module_page_id = 2110,
    order_in_page = 1,
    module_unlock_request = 315815,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear stage 58-15 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 216,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "The [c][f78585]collaboration[-][/c] between your company and CyberSec soon began. However, during planning meetings, Gavin clashed with the Bureau's technical team over the release of accompanying security software. Gavin emphasized the importance of launching on time, while the developers insisted the code had to be flawless before going live. To break the deadlock, you proposed a middle ground: the program would air as scheduled, while the software would be slowly improved in sync with the show's content. This compromise finally brought both sides to an [c][f78585]agreement[-][/c]. After the meeting, you accompanied Gavin to CyberSec to pick up some materials. In the break room, you overheard someone badmouthing Gavin for being too strict. He responded with a tired smile, saying he didn't mind it as long as you didn't see him that way. Before you left, he shared one final update: the scammer who had tricked Kiki had been caught."
  },
  [160410] = {
    module_page_id = 2110,
    order_in_page = 1,
    module_unlock_request = 315815,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear stage 58-15 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 216,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "Under the pretense of collecting content for the cybercrime awareness campaign, you accompanied Gavin to the police station. There, a suspect was surrounded by the victims he had allegedly scammed. Yet he claimed he, too, had been a victim—threatened in Odyssey by someone known only as [c][f78585]\"Black Shadow\"[-][/c]. When Gavin asked him to log into his account to retrieve chat logs with this mysterious figure, they discovered the suspect's account had already been mysteriously deleted."
  },
  [160411] = {
    module_page_id = 2110,
    order_in_page = 1,
    module_unlock_request = 315815,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear stage 58-15 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 216,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_connect_id = 160412,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_delay = 9,
    module_desc = "To dig deeper, you and Gavin went to Infinite and requested Aether's help accessing the game's internal data. But every trace of \"Black Shadow\" had been systematically wiped using unknown methods. Gavin suspected a security breach, while Aether firmly insisted the system was airtight. You paused and suggested another possibility—what if this was the work of a special [c][f78585]Evol[-][/c] ability? Aether seemed reluctant to connect the incident to Odyssey, but Gavin didn't back down."
  },
  [160412] = {
    module_page_id = 2110,
    order_in_page = 1,
    module_unlock_request = 315815,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear stage 58-15 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 216,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 2,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "\"I want his device signature and registration history—today.\"",
    role1 = 4150000,
    role2 = 402106,
    role3 = 402206,
    module_role_zoom_rate = 0.5,
    module_remove = "0,-200",
    module_background_id = 1103,
    module_voice = "voice_125808_18.mp3",
    module_voice_species = 0,
    module_voice_delay = 0.5
  },
  [160413] = {
    module_page_id = 2110,
    order_in_page = 1,
    module_unlock_request = 315815,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear stage 58-15 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 216,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "With internal access granted, the Special Task Force soon identified the headset serial number used by \"Black Shadow\" and tracked the purchase back to a man named Walter Sullivan. Gavin led a team to Walter's apartment while you monitored the operation remotely. Walter wasn't home, but his son, [c][f78585]Cody Sullivan[-][/c], opened the door. The boy admitted that his father hadn't returned in two days and was barely present even when he was. As you watched the cramped, aging apartment through the screen, a troubling thought crossed your mind—why would such a modest household own such an expensive headset? When technicians asked Cody, he said that his father had tampered with the device. That's when Tang interrupted, claiming the boy was lying."
  },
  [160414] = {
    module_page_id = 2110,
    order_in_page = 1,
    module_unlock_request = 315815,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear stage 58-15 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 216,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "Suddenly, Cody broke free and grabbed the headset. Then, he put it on and logged into Odyssey. No matter how loudly anyone called him, he wouldn't respond. It was as if he was gone. At that moment, Walter returned. He froze in the doorway at the sight of the police, and quickly revealed that the scammer in the game was his son all along. Gavin contacted Aether again. Aether warned that forcibly disconnecting Cody could cause permanent damage to his body. Determined to bring the boy back safely, Gavin decided to enter the game himself. At Infinite's headquarters, you watched from the command center as Gavin logged into Odyssey and located Cody in a virtual train station. But this Cody was nothing like the timid boy from earlier. He mocked the victims, saying they'd given him money willingly. He even lashed out at his father, calling him useless. The final straw came when he sneered at Gavin by saying he must have had a loving family growing up. Gavin lost his temper and punched him. Cody then used his Evol to break free from Gavin's grasp. He refused to return to the real world, claiming he no longer cared what happened to his body."
  },
  [160415] = {
    module_page_id = 2110,
    order_in_page = 1,
    module_unlock_request = 315815,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear stage 58-15 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 216,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 1,
    module_connect_id = 160416,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_delay = 12,
    module_desc = "Cody vanished and hid his in-game location. Back in the real world, his body had slipped into a [c][f78585]vegetative state[-][/c]. Infinite vowed to assist in tracking him down, and CyberSec also issued an apology. They admitted this incident had made them realize their mission went beyond coding software—they had a responsibility to protect people. Later, with the investigation complete, you and Gavin padded through the city. He was clearly still troubled. When sudden rain forced you both to take shelter in a park slide tunnel, you joked that you thought he might try to blow the storm clouds away. When he seriously considered it, you laughed and pulled him back."
  },
  [160416] = {
    module_page_id = 2110,
    order_in_page = 1,
    module_unlock_request = 315815,
    module_unlock_request_desc = "Clear stage 58-15 to unlock",
    module_vol_id = 216,
    module_season_id = 2,
    module_type = 3,
    module_to_module_delay = 0.5,
    module_desc = "\"Then let's just stay like this for a bit.\"",
    module_card_id = 54821,
    module_CG_zoom = 0.83,
    module_remove = "0,-200",
    module_voice = "voice_125810_48.mp3",
    module_voice_species = 0,
